{{!-- resetUrl is a secret: it reaches the template, never the database. --}}
{{#> paragraph}}Someone asked to reset the password for your {{appName}} account. If it was you, choose a new one below.{{/paragraph}}
{{> button url=resetUrl label="Choose a new password"}}
{{#> note}}This link works once and expires in {{expiresInMinutes}} minutes.{{/note}}
{{> link-fallback url=resetUrl}}
{{#> paragraph}}Didn't ask for this? You can ignore this email. Your password stays the same.{{/paragraph}}
